[node name="LoreIntro" parent="." unique_id=236771180 instance=ExtResource("7_lore")]
story_text = "FINAL LEVEL: THE PARKING LOT

The trail ends in the parking lot behind the burned-out data center.

There it is: Dylan's car. And sitting next to it... Tyler.

But something is wrong. Tyler ate every snack in the data center vending machines, and he is now ENORMOUS.

He throws traffic cones, and every time you hurt him, a granny drops out of the sky to help.

Climb the ledges, wait for him to walk underneath, and land on his head five times to get your car back!"

